<HEAD>PART 4262&#x2014;SPECIAL FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE BY PBGC
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 1302(b)(3), 1432.
</PSPACE></AUTH>
